              <div>
                <p className="font-semibold">{isVi ? "Sß║╡n s├áng ─æß╗â AI thiß║┐t kß║┐ lß╗ïch tß║¡p" : "Ready for AI to design your program"}</p>
                <p className="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">{isVi ? "AI sß║╜ chß╗ìn split, b├ái tß║¡p, sß╗æ set, reps, RIR v├á thß╗¥i gian nghß╗ë dß╗▒a tr├¬n cß║Ñu h├¼nh n├áy." : "AI will choose the split, exercises, sets, reps, RIR, and rest times from this setup."}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div className="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-background/40 p-4">
              <p className="label-micro mb-2">{isVi ? "Cß║Ñu h├¼nh cß╗ºa bß║ín" : "Your configuration"}</p>
